{
    "problemName": "find-the-celebrity",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "# The knows API is already defined for you.\r\n# return a bool, whether a knows b\r\n# def knows(a: int, b: int) -> bool:\r\n\r\n\r\nclass Solution:\r\n    def findCelebrity(self, n: int) -> int:\r\n        ans = 0\r\n        for i in range(1, n):\r\n            if knows(ans, i):\r\n                ans = i\r\n        for i in range(n):\r\n            if ans != i:\r\n                if knows(ans, i) or not knows(i, ans):\r\n                    return -1\r\n        return ans",
